  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Stability in Vulnerable Host Communities in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing livelihood and economic opportunities for vulnerable Lebanese and Palestinian and Syrian refugees in Lebanon with a focus on inclusion of women and youth. It also aims at strengthening the legislative reform agenda on protection of Palestine refugees with particular focus on employment-related rights.</narrative>
  </description>
